{"id":55,"date":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","date_gmt":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","modified_gmt":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","slug":"browse-all-listings","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/browse-all-listings\/","title":{"rendered":"Browse All Listings"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group page-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/browse-platforms.png\" alt=\"Browse psychic platforms\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Explore our complete directory of psychic platforms, readers, and services. Every listing has been independently reviewed by our editorial team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top-Rated Platforms<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kasamba &#8211; 4.8\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Industry leader with 20+ years of experience. Offers chat, phone, and email readings with a massive roster of vetted psychics. New user discount: 70% off + 3 free minutes.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keen &#8211; 4.7\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Huge network of readers with excellent filtering options. Competitive per-minute rates and a strong mobile app. Introductory offer: 5 minutes for $1.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Purple Garden &#8211; 4.6\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Modern app-first platform with video readings, transparent pricing, and an intuitive interface. Features a real-time availability indicator for each reader.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">California Psychics &#8211; 4.5\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Premium phone-focused service with one of the most rigorous reader screening processes in the industry. Known for consistently accurate readings and excellent customer support.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns has-2-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Psychic Source &#8211; 4.4\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Established service with a satisfaction guarantee. Strong specialists in love and relationship readings. Offers chat, phone, and video options.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Oranum &#8211; 4.3\/5<\/h3>\n\n\n<p>Free live video streaming platform where you can preview readers before booking a private session. Global reader community with 24\/7 availability.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Independent Readers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Beyond major platforms, our directory also features verified independent psychic readers who offer personalised, one-on-one sessions. Independent readers often provide a more intimate experience and may specialise in niche areas not commonly found on larger platforms.<\/p>\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Explore our complete directory of psychic platforms, readers, and services. Every listing has been independently reviewed by our editorial team. Top-Rated Platforms Kasamba &#8211; 4.8\/5 Industry le